@startuml RuntimeArchitecture
!theme plain

title Second Serving Runtime Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor "Browser" as Browser

node "Nginx\nsecondserving-nginx" as Nginx {
  artifact "Vite build\nfrontend/dist" as FrontendDist
}

node "Spring Boot API\nsecondserving-app" as App

database "PostgreSQL + PostGIS\nsecondserving-db" as Db

Browser --> Nginx : HTTPS
Nginx --> FrontendDist : serve static assets\nand React Router fallback
Nginx --> App : proxy /api/*
App --> Db : JDBC\nJPA/Hibernate\nPostGIS queries

note right of Nginx
  Owns TLS, static files,
  SPA fallback, API proxying,
  and basic API rate limiting.
end note

note right of App
  Owns auth, authorization,
  validation, business rules,
  listings, reservations,
  and geospatial search.
end note

note bottom of Db
  db_data is a named volume
  for persistent database storage.
end note

@enduml
